    "tips": [
      "The template installs infrastructure only and never bundles cameras or a Frigate configuration file.",
      "VA-API accelerates video decode/encode; it is separate from object detection with Coral, OpenVINO, ROCm or TensorRT.",
      "The rolling stable image is kept intact. If unrelated native modules fail intermittently, validate host RAM and CPU stability before changing packages inside the image.",
      "GPU passthrough is independent of Coral. Configure Frigate FFmpeg hwaccel_args using preset-vaapi or preset-nvidia; passing devices does not change existing camera configuration. NVIDIA channel workload validation pending."
